---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Boise Tree Pros"
  description="Privacy policy for Boise Tree Pros. How we collect, use, and protect your information."
  canonical="https://boisetreepro.com/privacy/"
  ogTitle="Privacy Policy | Boise Tree Pros"
  ogDescription="Privacy policy for Boise Tree Pros. How we collect, use, and protect your information."
  ogImage="https://boisetreepro.com/images/og-image.png"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
<style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #363636; background: #FAF0E6; }
    h1,h2,h3,h4 { font-family: 'Zilla Slab', Georgia, serif; }

    .nav-link {
      color: #FAF0E6;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.18s, color 0.18s;
    }
    .nav-link:hover { background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
    .nav-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #87CEEB; outline-offset: 2px; }
    .nav-link:active { opacity: 0.7; }

    .dropdown-link { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 10px 18px; min-height: 48px; font-size: 14px; color: #363636; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, opacity 0.2s; outline: none; }
    .dropdown-link:hover { background-color: #f0e8de; color: #1A531A; }
    .dropdown-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #1A531A; outline-offset: -2px; }
    .dropdown-link:active { background-color: #e0d4c4; }

    .footer-link {
      color: #d4c5b0;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: color 0.18s;
    }
    .footer-link:hover { color: #FAF0E6; }
    .footer-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #87CEEB; outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 2px; }
    .footer-link:active { opacity: 0.7; }

    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #1A531A;
      color: #FAF0E6;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background-color 0.18s, transform 0.15s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(26,83,26,0.35), 0 1px 3px rgba(26,83,26,0.2);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background-color: #16451a; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(26,83,26,0.4), 0 2px 6px rgba(26,83,26,0.25); }
    .btn-primary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #87CEEB; outline-offset: 3px; }
    .btn-primary:active { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.88; }

    .prose h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1A531A; margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .prose h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; color: #363636; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem; }
    .prose p { line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .prose ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .prose ul li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .prose ol { list-style: decimal; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .prose ol li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .prose strong { color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 600; }
    .prose a { color: #1A531A; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    .prose a:hover { color: #8B5A2B; }

    /* mobile menu */
    #mobile-menu { display: none; }
    #mobile-menu.open { display: block; }
  </style>
<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://boisetreepro.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Privacy Policy", "item": "https://boisetreepro.com/privacy/" }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-4">
  <ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#888;">
    <li><a href="/" style="color:#8B5A2B;text-decoration:none;">Home</a></li>
    <li>/</li>
    <li style="color:#363636;">Privacy Policy</li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0F3010 0%, #1A531A 40%, #2A6B2A 100%);padding:64px 0 72px;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div style="max-width:720px;">
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,44px);font-weight:700;color:#FAF0E6;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:rgba(250,240,230,0.85);max-width:620px;">What we collect when you browse this site or call the number on it, who else receives it, and how to ask us to delete it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:64px 0 80px;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="prose" style="max-width:760px;">

      <p>This policy explains what Boise Tree Pros collects when you use this website or call the number on it, why we collect it, and who else receives it.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Boise Tree Pros operates boisetreepro.com as a referral service for tree care in Boise and the Treasure Valley. We are not a tree care contractor. See our <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure</a> for how that works.</p>

      <h2>Information you give us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>When you use the contact form:</strong> your name, phone number, email address, property location, and whatever you write about the job.</li>
        <li><strong>When you call:</strong> your phone number, the time and length of the call, and the number you dialled.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Calls are tracked, and may be recorded</h2>
      <p>The phone numbers on this site are tracking numbers. When you call, the connection is handled by a call-routing provider that records call metadata &mdash; the originating number, the time, the duration, and which page or campaign the number appeared on &mdash; so that the referral can be attributed and paid for.</p>
      <p><strong>Calls may also be recorded by the provider or by the contractor who answers.</strong> Where a call is recorded you will normally hear a notice at the start of the call. If you would rather not be recorded, say so when the call connects, or use the contact form instead.</p>
      <p>Call records are shared with the contractor receiving your enquiry and with the advertising network that connects the call, because both need them to handle your job and to account for the referral.</p>

      <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
      <p>Like most websites, we receive technical information from your browser: IP address, browser and device type, referring page, and which pages you viewed. We use two analytics tools:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> &mdash; aggregate traffic measurement. IP anonymisation is enabled. Google's practices are covered by the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> &mdash; records how pages are used, including scrolling and clicks, so we can find broken or confusing layouts. See the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Both set cookies. Most browsers let you block or delete cookies in their settings; the site works without them.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To connect you with a tree care contractor serving your area.</li>
        <li>To respond to what you asked us.</li>
        <li>To understand which pages are useful and which are not.</li>
        <li>To account for referrals with the contractor or network that pays for them.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not send marketing email or texts from this site.</p>

      <h2>Who receives your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>The contractor</strong> who takes your enquiry. Once your details reach them, their own privacy practices apply, not ours.</li>
        <li><strong>Our call-routing and advertising network partners</strong>, for connection and attribution.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics providers</strong>, as described above.</li>
        <li><strong>Anyone we are legally required to disclose to</strong>, such as in response to lawful process.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Enquiry and call records are retained for as long as needed to handle the enquiry and to account for the referral, and then deleted. Analytics data is retained on the schedule set by each analytics provider.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Ask us what we hold about you, or ask us to delete it.</li>
        <li>Ask not to be recorded when a call connects.</li>
        <li>Block cookies in your browser, or use its Do Not Track setting.</li>
        <li>Use the contact form rather than the phone if you prefer not to be called back.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To make any of these requests, <a href="/#contact">contact us</a>. Note that once your details have been passed to a contractor, you will need to contact them directly about what they hold.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is intended for adults arranging work on property. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>The site is served over HTTPS and we take reasonable measures to protect what we hold. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes materially we will update the date below. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the revised policy.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy, or about information we hold: <a href="/#contact">get in touch</a>.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:2.5rem;font-size:14px;color:#888;">Last updated: 19 August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
